      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00236",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "无论大王怎么说，你不想说，就不要说。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No matter what the great king says, if you do not want to speak, then do not speak.",
          "g": "predicate"
